# The Vite build writes the real SPA here (build.outDir). None of it is tracked —
# the built assets AND the generated index.html are produced in Docker/CI, not
# committed. We track only an empty .gitkeep so `go:embed all:dist` always has a
# file to embed (the Go-only CI jobs build without running Vite). Vite runs with
# emptyOutDir:false (see web/vite.config.ts) so a local build never deletes the
# sentinel; because index.html is ignored too, a local build leaves git clean —
# no more checking out an overwritten placeholder.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
